{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/Customization","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Localization","anchor":"Localization","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To customize strings, see: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/Localization","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Styling","anchor":"Styling","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, to change the section header titles and form field titles in the Drop-in to red, and turn the submit button’s background to black with white foreground:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"tabs":[{"title":"Drop-in","content":[{"syntax":"swift","code":["var style = DropInComponent.Style()","style.listComponent.sectionHeader.title.color = .red","style.formComponent.textField.title.color = .red","style.formComponent.mainButtonItem.button.backgroundColor = .black","style.formComponent.mainButtonItem.button.title.color = .white","","let configuration = DropInComponent.Configuration(style: style)","let component = DropInComponent(paymentMethods: paymentMethods,","                                context: context,","                                configuration: configuration)"],"type":"codeListing"}]},{"content":[{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var style = FormComponentStyle()","style.backgroundColor = .black","style.header.title.color = .white","style.textField.title.color = .white","style.textField.text.color = .white","style.switch.title.color = .white","","let config = CardComponent.Configuration(style: style)","let component = CardComponent(paymentMethod: paymentMethod,","                              context: context,","                              configuration: config)"]}],"title":"Components"}],"type":"tabNavigator"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Custom Payment Method Display Information","ancho